WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.430
The takeaway is simple.

00:00:01.510 --> 00:00:06.485
Capping per-language repeats, and spreading the
rest of the budget uniformly,

00:00:06.565 --> 00:00:10.162
beats temperature sampling for multilingual pretraining,

00:00:10.242 --> 00:00:12.854
and that advantage holds as models scale.

00:00:12.934 --> 00:00:18.040
UniMax is a drop-in, hyperparameter-light
replacement for temperature sampling,

00:00:18.120 --> 00:00:23.030
and it ships with a refreshed corpus and umT5
checkpoints you can use today.
